      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "B588972BCEF95112",
      "text": "Êtes-vous un habitué... ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "B588962BCEF94F5F",
      "text": "Est-ce que c’est le plat secret du menu... ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_02a",
      "hash64": "D9E80F031FC409E9",
      "text": "Oui, en effet... On peut dire que je viens\\nsouvent ici.[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_03a",
      "hash64": "D9EAF3031FC6102C",
      "text": "Serais-tu l’un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e des candidat[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]es à l’examen\\nde l’Arène, par hasard ?[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_02b",
      "hash64": "D9E80C031FC404D0",
      "text": "À vrai dire, c’est un plat tout ce qu’il y a de\\nplus normal...[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_04",
      "hash64": "AE31B95429DB5560",
      "text": "Une chose est sûre, en tout cas : ajouter un filet\\nde [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]citron [VAR 0xFF00(0000)]apporte un petit goût frais délicieux\\r\\nà n’importe quel plat.[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 1,
